## Limitations

This project is a practical demonstration and uses a relatively simple neural-network architecture.

Potential limitations include:

* The model may incorrectly classify visually similar products.
* Test accuracy does not capture every aspect of real-world performance.
* Fashion-MNIST images are simplified compared with real-world e-commerce product photographs.
* Human review may still be required for uncertain predictions.

---

## Future Enhancements

A production-oriented version could explore:

* Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs)
* Transfer learning
* Real-world product-image datasets
* Confidence thresholds
* Human-in-the-loop review
* Model monitoring
* Automated product-tag generation
* Integration with an e-commerce catalog system

---

## Project Objective

The core objective is to demonstrate how **Deep Learning can convert visual product data into actionable business information**, while highlighting the importance of model accuracy, human oversight, and responsible deployment.

